    "name": "Use and access constraints (from the FGDC record; no license is granted)",
    "text": "Use constraints: Boundary accurracy is restricted to 1:250,000 scale and smaller. Access constraints: Upon completion of the database data will be available as per State of Alaska Chapter 6 of the State of Alaska Administrative Code signed November 1994, Alaska Statutes A.S.09.25.110-09.220. Distribution liability: While every effort has been made to ensure that these data are accurate and reliable within the limits of the current state of the art, NOAA cannot assume liability for any damages caused by any errors or omissions in the data, nor as a result of the failure of the data to function on a particular system. NOAA makes no warranty, expressed or implied, nor does the fact of distribution constitute such a warranty."
